  "collectionNotes": [
    "All five exact-SKU CAD sources come from complete M5_Hardware18de3bb inventory and official Structure links; retained meshes use rigid transforms only.",
    "Populated PCB, hidden hardware, pin1 mating orientation and actual paper stock remain unknown. Continuous label bridges retain exact photo evidence; no invented plastic support.",
    "Board/peripheral execution is unavailable. Preview geometry and metadata do not establish firmware compatibility.",
    "Browser image decode, matching-angle photo overlay, side view and hardware acceptance remain unverified.",
    "Actual batch020 compiled production Worker/WASM checks passed this SKU and its configured negatives; exact guest observations and hashes: docs/platform/evidence/m5-edge-runtime-20261126/worker-020.json. This validates the declared digital subset, not factory firmware or physical hardware."
  ]
